// lib/@android/std/clipboard.fi -- std.clipboard on Android (picked instead of
// lib/std/clipboard.fi by the Android target): there is NO windowless clipboard
// there. The system clipboard of an Android program is the one of its Window
// (lib/window/android.fi, `window.clipboard_set` / `clipboard_get`), and a
// program with a window uses those. Every function answers false (no crash).

